# wendy

--- FutureGirl_overcharge | hypercharge | TID_FUTURE_GIRL_OVERCHARGE_DESC
raw  Increased Shield Generator health and absorb <VALUE>% of damage taken by Wendy or her teammates.
now  Increased Shield Generator health and absorb 1% of damage taken by Wendy or her teammates.
  VALUE  1  -> 90

--- FutureGirl_unique_2 | star power | TID_FUTURE_GIRL_SP_2_DESC
raw  Wendy's shield generator gains an additional <!card.value.scaleToLevel> health.
now  Wendy's shield generator gains an additional 2000 health.
  card.value.scaleToLevel  2000  -> 1200

--- FutureGirl_ulti | super | TID_FUTURE_GIRL_ULTI_DESC
raw  Wendy deploys a shield generator that absorbs <VALUE>% of damage taken by Wendy and her teammates within its range.
now  Wendy deploys a shield generator that absorbs <VALUE>% of damage taken by Wendy and her teammates within its range.
  VALUE  -  -> 60
